WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.019 --> 00:00:04.779
- [Victor] This world can
make you feel alone sometimes,

00:00:04.779 --> 00:00:07.099
but I think the most
important thing to do in life

00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:11.069
is always be there when
somebody needs you.

00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:14.669
- [Ginger] I had been driving
by him for almost three years.

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:18.408
He would stand there rain or shine.

00:00:18.408 --> 00:00:22.339
I decided I needed to stop
and find out why he was there.

00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:24.079
- [Victor] I used to stand
right there on that corner.

00:00:24.079 --> 00:00:27.960
My mother would meet me there
sometimes whenever she could.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.210
That's just a place that she could meet me

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.131
if ever she was looking for me.

00:00:33.131 --> 00:00:34.427
- [Ginger] Because he couldn't find her,

00:00:34.427 --> 00:00:38.011
he just wanted to make sure
she knew that he was okay,

00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:40.611
which I thought was so beautiful.

00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:43.149
He has this wisdom that
comes up from inside of him

00:00:43.149 --> 00:00:47.571
that can only come from love
that is just unconditional.

00:00:47.571 --> 00:00:50.154
(gentle music)

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.331
- [Patrick] We were getting
phone calls from people

00:00:59.331 --> 00:01:01.349
who were saying, "get
this guy off your corner."

00:01:01.349 --> 00:01:04.808
Everyone on my crew would
check on him on a daily basis.

00:01:04.808 --> 00:01:05.641
- [Bodak] What's going on?

00:01:05.641 --> 00:01:06.474
- [Victor] Alright.

00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:07.307
- [Man] Victor, how are you today?

00:01:07.307 --> 00:01:09.169
- [Victor] I'm doing good,
I'm glad to see everybody.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.108
- [Patrick] Some would go in
the morning and check on him

00:01:11.108 --> 00:01:12.571
and then go back in the evening.

00:01:12.571 --> 00:01:14.371
He'd ask us how we were doing,

00:01:14.371 --> 00:01:17.908
and we would ask him how he
was doing and what he needed.

00:01:17.908 --> 00:01:20.771
He stood on the corner,
people gave him money,

00:01:20.771 --> 00:01:22.371
but he didn't want the money.

00:01:22.371 --> 00:01:24.789
Victor said, "I'm just waiting on my mom."

00:01:24.789 --> 00:01:27.759
And as soon as we told all
those people the story,

00:01:27.759 --> 00:01:31.509
the outpour from this
community was enormous.

00:01:33.131 --> 00:01:36.298
(inspirational music)

00:01:43.661 --> 00:01:46.120
- [Ginger] Last Thanksgiving,
when I drove up on the corner

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.278
where he was, I think he
had enough food to feed

00:01:48.278 --> 00:01:50.549
probably five families.

00:01:50.549 --> 00:01:52.349
It was all spread out all over the ground,

00:01:52.349 --> 00:01:55.051
and he was just standing
there in the middle of it.

00:01:55.051 --> 00:01:56.891
There were so many people in our community

00:01:56.891 --> 00:02:00.589
that cared about him, but he
didn't need another sandwich.

00:02:00.589 --> 00:02:02.672
He needed that next step.

00:02:03.719 --> 00:02:05.109
It was at that point that my husband said,

00:02:05.109 --> 00:02:05.942
"You know, I really feel like

00:02:05.942 --> 00:02:08.480
"he needs to come and stay with us."

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.781
This is a lifelong journey.

00:02:10.781 --> 00:02:12.919
Victor is part of my family.

00:02:12.919 --> 00:02:14.000
He has a mother.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.299
One is enough, he told me.

00:02:15.299 --> 00:02:19.351
And so we've decided
that I'm the big sister.

00:02:19.351 --> 00:02:22.032
- It's like coming home
and you just try to be

00:02:22.032 --> 00:02:24.240
a nice person ‘cause you treat people like

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.341
you like to be treated.

00:02:25.341 --> 00:02:27.301
- You told me that you were my gift.

00:02:27.301 --> 00:02:29.352
- Yeah, I am your gift, you know?

00:02:29.352 --> 00:02:31.038
- Yes, you are my gift.
- Yeah, because...

00:02:31.038 --> 00:02:33.301
Yeah, if you believe, only if you believe.

00:02:33.301 --> 00:02:34.134
- Aww.

00:02:35.159 --> 00:02:36.811
(Victor laughs)

00:02:36.811 --> 00:02:38.152
- We've gotten to know so many people

00:02:38.152 --> 00:02:40.501
in our community because of Victor.

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:44.032
A dentist did a tremendous
amount of dental work for him.

00:02:44.032 --> 00:02:48.021
A karate studio gave him tai chi lessons.

00:02:48.021 --> 00:02:49.480
- [Patrick] We're a close-knit community,

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.312
we take care of our own.

00:02:51.312 --> 00:02:54.061
Victor was one of our own.

00:02:54.061 --> 00:02:55.651
- [Ginger] Victor and
I, we stopped and cared

00:02:55.651 --> 00:02:56.520
about each other.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.771
That's what friends do.

00:02:58.771 --> 00:03:00.560
- [Victor] Friends come and
go, so you need the ones

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:02.893
that are gonna stick by you.

